        <mxCell id="proxy" value="Live proxy :8090&#xa;forward unchanged to crAPI :8888&#xa;build APIEvent" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;fontStyle=1;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="430" y="150" width="300" height="70" as="geometry"/>
